{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1519205-clan-novel-campaigns","id":1519205,"title":"Clan Novel campaigns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-30T16:46:17-07:00","id":1519205,"title":"Clan Novel campaigns","content":"Anyone ever adapt the Clan Novels into their campaigns? I haven't, but I've always wanted to have a Sabbat pack operating out of Montreal, taking part in the crusade and also visiting Mexico City. Could see it leading into the 4th Civil War or Gehenna War.<br /> <br /> The flip side would be with Camarilla refugees and culminating with the taking of NYC, which could roll into NY by Night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-30T21:15:41-07:00","id":1519224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yab</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1519205-clan-novel-campaigns#post1519205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone ever adapt the Clan Novels into their campaigns? I haven't, but I've always wanted to have a Sabbat pack operating out of Montreal, taking part in the crusade and also visiting Mexico City. Could see it leading into the 4th Civil War or Gehenna War.<br /> <br /> The flip side would be with Camarilla refugees and culminating with the taking of NYC, which could roll into NY by Night.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm in a weird place in relation to this with my current chronicle, that mixes and matches bits of metaplot from several editions with some of the videogames - (one of my PCs is an apocryphal version of Bloodlines protagonist, two others come from Redemption and we have a self-proclaimed &quot;bride/childe of Dracula&quot; to boot) - NY has been taken by the Camarilla but Polonia was <i>already </i>gone and leading the Gehenna Crusade in the middle east among other things, while Vykos &amp; co were doing their own thing in the United States &amp; Mexico and <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Don_Medina_Sidonia\" target=\"_blank\">Don Medina Sidonia</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Lisette_Vizquel\" target=\"_blank\">Lisette Vizquel</a> led their own campaign in Cuba, Florida and the caribbean in parallel to Katrina (some even whisper that they <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Under_a_Blood_Red_Moon\" target=\"_blank\"><b>caused</b></a>, through the support of Abyss Mystics led by <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Ambrosio_Luis_Mon%C3%A7ada\" target=\"_blank\">Don Mon\u00e7ada</a>, that time's <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_Atlantic_hurricane_season\" target=\"_blank\">unprecented wave of hurricanes</a>).<br /> <br /> So i have yet to decide when and how i'm going to use any characters of the clan novels - though Khalil Ravana and other characters involved in the Eye of Hazimel are a definite must, since there's something i'm doing some work on that could or not be Hazimel himself...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-31-2023, 09:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T02:35:31-07:00","id":1519233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1519205-clan-novel-campaigns?p=1519224#post1519224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> one of my PCs is an apocryphal version of Bloodlines protagonist, two others come from Redemption</div> </div> </div> </div>So I'm not the only one who use video game characters as their own (my PC is the protagonist from Werewolf: the Apocalypse: Heart of Gaia game) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T04:30:31-07:00","id":1519237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1519205-clan-novel-campaigns?p=1519233#post1519233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So I'm not the only one who use video game characters as their own (my PC is the protagonist from Werewolf: the Apocalypse: Heart of Gaia game) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Far from it, 3 of my 6 players have escapees from either Bloodlines or Redemption as characters - and a fourth one is inspired by the <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Cities\" target=\"_blank\">Twin Cities</a> as presented in Winter's Teeth, a V5-based comic series (though with some major diferences).\u200b<br /> <br /> (If any events of its Werewolf spin-off/sequel, Crimson Thaw, will ever get into the mix, that's for him to guess and me to see in the future)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-31-2023, 07:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-09T09:19:57-07:00","id":1520211,"title":"","content":"We adapted elements of the Clan Lasombra trilogy of novels into our game to explain the fall of the Sabbat and used Lambach Ruthhaven and a homemade Lasombra elder who learned the truth as a starting point. Most of the time we don't really use the clan novels much other then an odd reference point in our games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}